    "body": "Review blocker fixed in 698003fe (PR stays draft).\n\nChange: `SetPlate` no longer unmounts riders. New crate-private `UpdateModel::keeping_plate()` drops the plate snapshot/unmount; `SetPlate::new` uses it (it re-seats riders on the edited grid itself and refuses jaw intrusions, per #833). Real mesh changes (re-import, cam.import, RepairModel, ImportFixture) still unmount. Also re-indented the `notes.push` lines in plate_dto.rs.\n\nPin: `fixture_plate_riders::an_edited_plate_keeps_its_riders_mounted` - 300x300 plate, block on B2, SetPlate pitch_x 25.4: rider still mounted, `MoveFixture` on the plate carries 1, undo/redo exact.\n\nGate: app fixture_plate_followups, fixture_plate, fixture_plate_riders, mod_vise_plate, mcp_plate, commands_undo, repair_model, import all green; clippy -D warnings on app clean; Linux quick gate: app suites ok, ui suites ok, 0 failed.",
